title: 'a-clock: native mobile alarm notifications + YouTube embed hardening'
summary: Implemented mobile alarm firing via OS-scheduled local notifications (Tauri notification plugin Schedule.at for one-time, weekly Schedule.interval per repeat day) so alarms fire on iOS/Android when the app is backgrounded/locked; no-op on desktop where the tray + JS scheduler + pmset handle it. Also fixed a YouTube embed failure (Error 153, origin/referrer rejection) by hardening the embed URL (send window origin when http(s), switch to youtube-nocookie.com, add playsinline/modestbranding) and setting the iframe referrerPolicy, plus adding a reliable 'Open on YouTube' button that launches the video in the system browser via the opener plugin.
symbols_touched:
  - '#mobile-alarms'
  - '#youtube'
  - '#trigger-player'
  - '#wake'
  - '#native'
  - $alarm-lifecycle
